	(text "Notes:\n\nFT = 5v tolerant\n_f = I/O, Fm+ capable\n_a = I/O, with analog switch function\n\nFor STM32G0B1, the two UCPD CC pins are:\nPA8 (UCPD1_CC1)\nPB15 (UCPD1_CC2)\nDisable UCPD1 pull-downs to make these pins work as normal GPIOs\n"
